values ('c5d6e7f8-9a0b-4c73-8e23-3f4a5b6c7d03', 'branding-and-identity-design', 'Branding and Identity Design', 'Branding and Identity Design is an advanced Year 3 studio course in logos, brand systems, and visual identity. Students learn to connect strategy, research, positioning, verbal identity, marks, typography, color, imagery, guidelines, applications, and implementation into a coherent identity system. The course is designed for graphic design students preparing for senior studio, portfolio review, internships, and professional client work. It balances strategic brand thinking with rigorous visual craft, critique, systems documentation, ethical judgment, accessibility, and real-world presentation.');

